{"data":{"id":"bthL_m1jtb0","slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"m8r9WlGVpuc","slug":"indecision-flamingosis-bad-word-edit","title":"Indecision (Flamingosis [bad word] Edit)"},{"id":"wq1dEbESt3E","slug":"without","title":"Without"},{"id":"4KQLT-UueX0","slug":"too-much","title":"Too Much"},{"id":"0EICR5afwJQ","slug":"plastic-100c-dexter-dukarus-remix","title":"Plastic 100°C (Dexter Dukarus Remix)"},{"id":"Ez2_MVYyoP0","slug":"indecision","title":"Indecision"},{"id":"AKhQAEUTmIE","slug":"plastic-100-c-remastered","title":"Plastic 100 C [remastered]"}]},"markers":[{"id":"F2czduE70m0","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sampha - Indecision (Flamingosis [bad word] Edit)","track":{"id":"m8r9WlGVpuc","path":"/artists/sampha/tracks/indecision-flamingosis-bad-word-edit/","slug":"indecision-flamingosis-bad-word-edit","title":"Indecision (Flamingosis [bad word] Edit)","artist":{"slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xEj4AlSU7Es","slug":"137","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-137-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #137 w/ Mr. Carmack & Mikos Da Gawd","artwork":"/images/episodes/137.jpg","content":"\nMikos Da Gawd and Mr. Carmack each drop amazing sets of unreleased, original productions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe Kay kicked things off for the first half of the show! He dropped a lot of exclusives and forgotten gems. Mikos Da Gawd dropped a 30+ minute DJ set that consisted of many gems and original productions from the man himself. Mr. Carmack wrapped up the show with an amazing listening session of all of his latest unreleased works. Man, all we gotta say is that Carmack is one of the best in the game right now. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Mr. Carmack","position":3}},{"id":"9m8k1tjZ4Rc","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sampha - Without","track":{"id":"wq1dEbESt3E","path":"/artists/sampha/tracks/without/","slug":"without","title":"Without","artist":{"slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha"},"artwork":"images/artists/sampha/tracks/without.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"DaeFzk923xc","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sampha - Without","track":{"id":"wq1dEbESt3E","path":"/artists/sampha/tracks/without/","slug":"without","title":"Without","artist":{"slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha"},"artwork":"images/artists/sampha/tracks/without.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"D8zdxMNlask","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sampha - Too Much","track":{"id":"4KQLT-UueX0","path":"/artists/sampha/tracks/too-much/","slug":"too-much","title":"Too Much","artist":{"slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha"},"artwork":"images/artists/sampha/tracks/too-much.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"bFTrJ22meoo","slug":"197","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-197"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #197","artwork":"/images/episodes/197.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10837,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Set","position":0}},{"id":"LYWa0nnKXAQ","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sampha - Plastic 100 C [remastered]","track":{"id":"AKhQAEUTmIE","path":"/artists/sampha/tracks/plastic-100-c-remastered/","slug":"plastic-100-c-remastered","title":"Plastic 100 C [remastered]","artist":{"slug":"sampha","title":"Sampha"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2VzgalrnHZc","slug":"268","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-268-ft-jerreau"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #268 w/ Jerreau","artwork":"/images/episodes/268.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7155,"location":"U